p.src:
A geodesic is obtained by transporting its own tangent parallel to itself: $\frac{D t^m}{Ds}=0.$ With an affine parameter this becomes $\boxed{
  \frac{d^2x^m}{ds^2}
  +
  \Gamma^m{}_{np}
  \frac{dx^n}{ds}
  \frac{dx^p}{ds}
  =0
  }.$

